From e2b3a34965b6055d216019143160207aff68123f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SheepyLord <37598021+SheepyLord@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 15:20:10 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Keep VR output bounded and recoverable across queued frames

Gate output on its latched camera, defer captures until traced output, isolate overlay observation to the render context, catch DXVK allocation failures, preserve sessions across focus loss, bound timing records and select the supported upscaler. Wire API 3 adds wait/focus counters and enables memory requirements independently of FSR.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
